WEBVTT

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.120
Three! Two! One!

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:39.620
We are finally reaching the
climax of the special illusions!

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:45.700
Tonight, he will miraculously make
an entire building disappear!

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.580
I will now decide on a target.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:55.080
Even I do not know what the target will be!

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.500
It may be the parliament house or
the residence of the prime minister...

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.870
Perhaps even your own home!

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.620
Is this all right? We haven't
gotten permission from anyone...

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:08.790
We'll figure it out. Okay! Let him do it!

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.580
Okay! Okay! Do it! Do it!

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.080
This one!

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:28.580
Looks like the place has been chosen!

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.830
What place might that be?!

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:36.450
This will be the last target of the night!

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:40.620
The Lacuna Chemical Laboratory!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.910
"AFTERLOST"

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:17.950
"Episode 8: Choice"

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.370
Infiltrate from our side?!

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:47.700
We'd hunt down the principal they're
protecting and make him confess.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.160
It's a once in a lifetime chance
to bring down the Agency.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:57.120
It may become a battle
against Tama-shi, you know.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.120
I know.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.160
But we have no other choice.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.870
I...

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.700
Me, too.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.040
I will also go.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.120
Hold on!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.700
Shouldn't you stay near your little brother?

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.000
Thank you.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.870
But Souma is stable now...

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.660
I understand.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.250
I'll notify you if anything happens.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:41.540
I will now make the entire
Lacuna Chemical building disappear!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.250
If you live nearby, feel free
to come watch at the site.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.200
Lacuna Chemical! That's close by!

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.830
Mom, let's go!

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.660
The prime minister's lover in a place like this?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.040
Huh? You, too?

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.120
Yeah, we got a tip.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.160
Seems pretty bogus...

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.580
Hey! Something serious is
happening at Lacuna Chemical!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.750
Let's check it out.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:14.750
Yeah, seems this tip was a bust.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.790
They've started to move.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.660
What's going on?

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.250
Go put in a report!

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.410
Huh? Is Yoshiaki even here?

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.660
Isn't he already inside?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.250
The TV stations are here, though!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:36.580
--What do you think? Please give us
your opinion on what will happen.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.700
--Please let us inside.
--What do you think? Please give us
your opinion on what will happen.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:39.790
--Don't be stupid! Like we can do that!
--What do you think? Please give us
your opinion on what will happen.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.620
--Don't be stupid! Like we can do that!
--What are all of you saying?
Why are you all here?!

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.500
--What are all of you saying?
Why are you all here?!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.700
Excuse us!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.620
It has begun.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.080
Good work.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:26.370
Everyone online, can you see this?

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:31.830
This time, I've infiltrated this
place for Yoshiaki's special show.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.700
The Lacuna Chemical Laboratory.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.290
There are actually a lot of
dark rumors about this place.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:42.330
I was thinking about taking this chance
to look into those rumors, too.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:54.540
Right now, the inside of the Lacuna
Chemical Laboratory is streaming online.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:02.040
I am sure you will be able to see
the truth with your own eyes.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.450
Everyone here. Everyone watching on TV.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.700
Please confirm things with
your own eyes and ears.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.540
What the hell is he talking about?!

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.410
Wait.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.330
Huh?!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:16.200
It's interesting, so keep filming!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.330
But, is he going to make the
building disappear properly?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.580
Oh? Look at this!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:50.330
No matter how you look at it, this machine
has parts to tie people down!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:55.200
Headgear and restraints?!
This is a pharmaceutical company, right?!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.660
Why is there stuff like this here?

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:01.500
So the rumors about human
experimentation were true after all!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.160
Huh? What? Human experimentation?

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:08.000
It's serious! Huh? Wait, Lacuna?

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.790
Yeah! I already got an
informal offer from there!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.790
Hey, Yoshiaki is saying something on TV.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:19.450
I lost my parents at a young age.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.290
--My brother and I were sent to be
raised in a certain children's home.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.700
--I'm not taking responsibility for this...
--My brother and I were sent to be
raised in a certain children's home.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.450
--This feeling! This feeling!
--Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:27.660
--This is how live broadcasting should be!
--Light of Hope Academy for Disabled Children.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.910
My heart is racing!

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:36.540
The children there were used as subjects for
human experimentation by a certain company.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:39.080
That company was Lacuna Chemical.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.700
"Live and Exclusive"
That company was Lacuna Chemical.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.160
Doesn't look staged.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.120
This might end up being a court case.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:55.330
What is the meaning of this?! Are the
claims of human experimentation true?

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.120
Please leave!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.500
Hurry up and throw this away!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.250
Yes! Understood!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.370
You, too. Follow this list.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.410
This, too!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:11.370
To think they'd come and attack <i>us</i>.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.500
Insignificant insects...

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:32.160
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.750
Yes! I'm sorry!

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.290
Looks like you're doing well, principal.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.410
You... Why are you here?

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:47.160
Well, we heard you were the
overseeing director here.

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:50.040
From principal of the Light of Hope
Academy for Disabled Children...

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.540
A huge promotion!

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:58.410
Please explain yourself to us. Feel free.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.330
I have nothing to say!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.790
You have the responsibility to speak the truth.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.660
Answer. How long were you involved?

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:11.790
I've done nothing! I'm more of a victim!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.040
How long do you plan to live in disgrace?

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:17.870
Think of all the children that were sacrificed!

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.290
Shit!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.870
Oh. It dropped.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.700
Who were those guys in black?
They looked dangerous!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:31.000
Hey. Yoshiaki's followers have
suddenly increased by 200,000!

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.160
"The situation he created is
like an illusion in itself.
#yoshiaki has already stepped beyond
the boundaries of a magician?"

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.290
"I want to support #yoshiaki completely. What is this
world coming to? For an agency to get by committing
crimes like that. It's the end of the world. Anger."

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.660
Good work.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.750
How are things progressing?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.660
Great. You really did well.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:52.750
We can only put our trust in the public now.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:52.910
"Financial Registry"

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.580
"Financial Registry"
As this notebook proves,

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.200
Lacuna had been sending large
sums of money to the academy.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:02.370
That principal is now hired by Lacuna,

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:08.250
making it clear that they were both
involved with human trafficking.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:11.950
I have the confession statement from
that magician with me as well.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.450
This is our battle for Negishi to be at peace!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.790
If we don't move now, when will we ever move?!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:24.290
Right now, the inside of the Lacuna Chemical
Laboratory is streaming online.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:28.450
I am sure you will be able to see
the truth with your own eyes.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.660
Jeez, what a hassle.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.160
This is the end for you!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:49.620
It couldn't be helped.
We needed money to run the academy.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:54.700
I just couldn't let the
children become homeless.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:58.870
It couldn't be helped. It isn't my fault.

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:04.950
I was really thinking of the children.
Please believe me.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:09.660
The president and vice-president
of Lacuna Chemical

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.950
have been requested to volunteer
themselves for questioning.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.160
I'm Kakizaki, from the
first division of investigations.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:21.290
Sorry for the trouble, but we'd like all
responsible parties to come to the station.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:26.000
You seem awfully well prepared for this.
Do you have a warrant?

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:30.620
Since this is voluntary,
we do not mind if you refuse.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.040
Let's go.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.450
Please.

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:50.700
Though voluntary, you won't be
able to look so smug for long.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.250
We'll get warrants for your arrest soon.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:56.000
We have a mountain of charges.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.330
It's almost time.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:14.500
Yuki!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:15.750
Go back immediately!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:16.370
Huh?

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:17.200
What happened?

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.580
Souma's condition has changed.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.330
Commissioner!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.370
You may leave.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.160
But...

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.290
Didn't you hear me?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:53.410
My sincere apologies.
Please leave the rest to me.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.910
What is going on?!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.700
Huh?

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.620
What happened?!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.450
Why?!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:18.080
There is a distortion in gravitational
waves emitting from Souma!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.540
That can't be...

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.250
Takuya, this is the same phenomenon as the Lost!

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:30.330
The Lost is happening again?

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:49.000
This is bad. We have to get away from here!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.040
But you have to save Souma!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.790
I'm sorry...

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.700
...but we have already passed that point.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:05.540
Kikyo! Anonymously send out an evacuation
warning for the surrounding area!

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:11.450
I didn't hear about any plans like this.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:15.830
It was the perfect way to
make use of the useless Souma.

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:19.370
It's true that he was very unstable...

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:25.450
He cannot even control himself without
an Artifact. A failed creation.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:31.450
However, Souma did not go out of control
when Tsuki's Tears was destroyed.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.160
That's because she was close to him.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.160
It can't be?!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.950
His big sister acted as an Artifact.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:44.040
This time, he was triggered because
his sister is separated from him.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:51.750
That energy cannot be compared to the
Lost that occurred three years ago.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:27.000
They meant to drag us out into
the open, but... how pitiable.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.370
A fun bit of entertainment.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:34.160
No matter what, the Lost will occur.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:43.120
You all right?!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.250
Yes.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.410
Takuya, this place is dangerous!

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:49.000
We have no choice, but to evacuate for now.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.910
How can we stop Souma?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:05.000
Souma is a ticking bomb right now.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:10.410
The only saving grace is that
he is a living organism.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:13.290
By that, you don't mean...

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:18.160
If Souma's vital activity ceases, or...

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.450
No way...

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.790
I have to go.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.580
You can't!

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.910
I have to take on Souma...

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:31.910
Something like that is impossible!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.500
You don't know that!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:40.250
You were the one who told me
I wouldn't know unless I tried!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.910
Hang on tight!

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.830
Yuki!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.410
Akira!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.870
Yuki...

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:37.620
You don't have time to be
worrying about others.

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.080
Sir.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.370
Kouta!

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:46.620
Don't come...

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:50.910
I hate... you all...

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.830
Don't come...

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.000
Souma...

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.790
Don't come.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.830
Don't look.

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:20.120
Don't come.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:22.290
Don't look.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.330
I hate you.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.500
Don't look.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.580
Don't come.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.580
Don't come!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.200
Souma...

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.290
I'm sorry.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:19.950
Don't come.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.290
Don't look.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.750
Don't come!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:29.370
I'm scared. I don't want this... Sis.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.620
I don't want to die.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:41.910
Souma!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:47.580
Sis... Sis, I...

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:12.000
Stop. Sis... Sis...

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.660
It... didn't occur?

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:33.450
Even with my power,
I wasn't able to see this possibility.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:38.910
Daichi.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:44.580
Just how much do you plan to get in my way?

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:37.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:46.080
Next Episode: "Fate."
